These files are copies of the ones stored in libcamera main repo at:
https://git.libcamera.org/libcamera/libcamera.git/tree/include/libcamera

They are used by the Neo uGuzzi IPA to, among other things, use libcamera logging infrastructure.

These files are based on libcamera v0.6.0

Make sure these files are always aligned with the libcamera's.
